IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN §7.6, API.md S2, TYPES.md §3.1 (DECISIONS 380): pair (tier low) imports same
(tier high), E2007; an entry value edit keeps the finding (the Recheck path), and a project.canon
edit moving pair to tier high removes it.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  tiers {
    low: [pair]
    high: [same]
  }
}
-- same/same.canon --
/// Same.
package same

/// A mark.
record Mark {
  /// N.
  n: Int
}
-- pair/pair.canon --
/// Pair.
package pair

import same { Mark }

/// Marks.
let marks: table Mark = {}
-- pair/items/one.canon --
package pair

entry marks.one {
  n: 1
}
